inux / ROS host (data hub)\n- **mercat** — boat-side Windows / QINSy host (if a survey phase is reached)\n- **salmon** — operator station\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Date TBD** — set the title date when the deployment firms up.\n- The standing next-deployment scope (nav task-exec fixes #35 / #25 / #33 / #28, dry-run test bed) folds in here too; cross-link those as they land.\n\n---\n**Authored-By**: `Claude Code Agent`\n**Model**: `Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context)`","files":null}]}